","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SkeinResolutionObstruction.κ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SkeinResolutionObstruction.κ","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SkeinResolutionObstruction.lean#L45-L45","doc":"The Skein resolution obstruction `κ = res(χ(A))`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SkeinResolutionObstruction.res","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SkeinResolutionObstruction.res","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SkeinResolutionObstruction.lean#L43-L43","doc":"The resolution-tree restriction map (additive), `HH² ≅ ℤ → R`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SkeinResolutionObstruction.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SkeinResolutionObstruction.mk","kind":"ctor","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SkeinResolutionObstruction.lean#L40-L40","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SkeinResolutionObstruction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SkeinResolutionObstruction","kind":"structure","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SkeinResolutionObstruction.lean#L33-L47","doc":"Data for the Skein resolution obstruction on a link `L`, over the shared\nQOU obstruction context.\n\nA `definition` carrier: the additive resolution-tree restriction map `res`\n(from `HH² ≅ k = ℤ` to the coefficient ring `R`) and the obstruction\n`κ = res(χ(A))`, where `χ(A) = octx.chi_A` is the **canonical**\nuniversal class carried by `QouObstructionReductionContext`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:skein-resolution-obstruction","label":"def:skein-resolution-obstruction","md":"quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/skein-resolution-obstruction.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}